  "text": "```verilog\nmodule afifo #(\n\tparameter LGFIFO = 3,\n\tparameter WIDTH  = 16,\n\tparameter NFF    = 2,\n\tparameter [0:0]  WRITE_ON_POSEDGE = 1'b1,\n\tparameter [0:0]  OPT_REGISTER_READS = 1'b1\n) (\n\tinput  wire            i_wclk, i_wr_reset_n, i_wr,\n\tinput  wire [WIDTH-1:0] i_wr_data,\n\toutput reg             o_wr_full,\n\tinput  wire            i_rclk, i_rd_reset_n, i_rd,\n\toutput reg [WIDTH-1:0] o_rd_data,\n\toutput reg             o_rd_empty\n);\n\n\tlocalparam FIFO_DEPTH = 1 << LGFIFO;\n\tlocalparam GRAY_WIDTH = LGFIFO;\n\n\t// Write Pointer (Gray Code)\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] w_ptr_gray;\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] w_ptr_gray_next;\n\t\n\t// Read Pointer (Gray Code)\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] r_ptr_gray;\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] r_ptr_gray_next;\n\n\t// Internal pointers for logic (Binary)\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] w_ptr_bin;\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] r_ptr_bin;\n\n\t// Write Enable Logic\n\treg w_en;\n\treg w_en_next;\n\n\t// Read Enable Logic\n\treg r_en;\n\treg r_en_next;\n\n\t// Full Flag\n\treg full_flag;\n\treg full_flag_next;\n\n\t// Empty Flag\n\treg empty_flag;\n\treg empty_flag_next;\n\n\t// Write Data Register\n\treg [WIDTH-1:0] w_data_reg;\n\n\t// Read Data Register\n\treg [WIDTH-1:0] r_data_reg;\n\n\t// Write Pointer Register (Binary)\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] w_ptr_reg;\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] w_ptr_reg_next;\n\n\t// Read Pointer Register (Binary)\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] r_ptr_reg;\n\treg [GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] r_ptr_reg_next;\n\n\t// Write Enable State Machine\n\talways @(posedge i_wclk or negedge i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tw_en <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tif (WRITE_ON_POSEDGE) begin\n\t\t\t\tw_en_next = i_wr;\n\t\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\t\tw_en_next = i_wr;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tw_en <= w_en_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Read Enable State Machine\n\talways @(posedge i_rclk or negedge i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tr_en <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tr_en_next = i_rd;\n\t\t\tr_en <= r_en_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Write Pointer Logic (Binary)\n\talways @(posedge i_wclk or negedge i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tw_ptr_reg <= {GRAY_WIDTH{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tw_ptr_reg_next = w_ptr_reg;\n\t\t\tif (w_en) begin\n\t\t\t\tw_ptr_reg_next = w_ptr_reg + 1'b1;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tw_ptr_reg <= w_ptr_reg_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Read Pointer Logic (Binary)\n\talways @(posedge i_rclk or negedge i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tr_ptr_reg <= {GRAY_WIDTH{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tr_ptr_reg_next = r_ptr_reg;\n\t\t\tif (r_en) begin\n\t\t\t\tr_ptr_reg_next = r_ptr_reg + 1'b1;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tr_ptr_reg <= r_ptr_reg_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Write Pointer Gray Code Generation\n\talways @(posedge i_wclk or negedge i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tw_ptr_gray <= {GRAY_WIDTH{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tw_ptr_gray_next = w_ptr_gray;\n\t\t\tif (w_en) begin\n\t\t\t\tw_ptr_gray_next = w_ptr_gray ^ (1 << (w_ptr_reg[GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] & 1'b1));\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tw_ptr_gray <= w_ptr_gray_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Read Pointer Gray Code Generation\n\talways @(posedge i_rclk or negedge i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tr_ptr_gray <= {GRAY_WIDTH{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tr_ptr_gray_next = r_ptr_gray;\n\t\t\tif (r_en) begin\n\t\t\t\tr_ptr_gray_next = r_ptr_gray ^ (1 << (r_ptr_reg[GRAY_WIDTH-1:0] & 1'b1));\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tr_ptr_gray <= r_ptr_gray_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Full Flag Logic\n\talways @(posedge i_wclk or negedge i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tfull_flag <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tfull_flag_next = full_flag;\n\t\t\tif (w_en) begin\n\t\t\t\tfull_flag_next = (w_ptr_reg == (FIFO_DEPTH - 1));\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tfull_flag <= full_flag_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Empty Flag Logic\n\talways @(posedge i_rclk or negedge i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tempty_flag <= 1'b1;\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tempty_flag_next = empty_flag;\n\t\t\tif (r_en) begin\n\t\t\t\tempty_flag_next = (r_ptr_reg == 0);\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tempty_flag <= empty_flag_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Write Data Register\n\talways @(posedge i_wclk or negedge i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_wr_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tw_data_reg <= {WIDTH{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tw_data_reg_next = w_data_reg;\n\t\t\tif (w_en && !full_flag) begin\n\t\t\t\tw_data_reg_next = i_wr_data;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tw_data_reg <= w_data_reg_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Read Data Register\n\talways @(posedge i_rclk or negedge i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\tif (!i_rd_reset_n) begin\n\t\t\tr_data_reg <= {WIDTH{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tr_data_reg_next = r_data_reg;\n\t\t\tif (r_en && !empty_flag) begin\n\t\t\t\tr_data_reg_next = w_data_reg;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tr_data_reg <= r_data_reg_next;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Output Assignments\n\tassign o_wr_full = full_flag;\n\tassign o_rd_data = r_data_reg;\n\tassign o_rd_empty = empty_flag;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
